<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>02 · 业务怎么用</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            专题｜定时任务与主动关怀：不是等你问，是该出现时自己出现
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        {/* 三种触发 */}
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 14, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>按时刻</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>每天 8 点、每周一早上，固定时点触发。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>按间隔</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>每 2 小时巡检一次，周期性重复执行。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF7E9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: '600', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>指定时间 / 事件</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>到期前、里程碑日、收到触发消息时执行。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 六类用法 */}
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, gap: 6 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB' }}>日报周报自动出稿</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569' }}>读数据、写摘要、推送到指定群，到点就绪</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB' }}>数据看板与预警</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569' }}>指标异常主动提醒，把事后发现变成提前预警</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB' }}>网页操作批量回放</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569' }}>一次后台操作录成技能，之后按计划自动重放</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB' }}>主动关怀推送</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569' }}>续约、回款、保修到期前主动提醒相关负责人</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottomWidth: 1, borderBottomColor: '#E2E8F0', borderBottomStyle: 'solid' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB' }}>团队知识沉淀</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569' }}>定时整理本周新增文档与问答，汇入知识库</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 220, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB' }}>巡检与值守</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569' }}>按点检查服务状态与关键指标，异常即时上报</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 结论条 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EEFB', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, marginTop: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>
                主动性的价值：重要的事不再依赖某个人的记性——提醒、汇报、巡检按点发生。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
